WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Critter Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Critter Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.200
Step 2: Drag parts onto the body. Blobs and limbs stick where they touch. Legs come in pairs.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:21.200
Step 3: Or start from a Starter Critter. Four ready-made Critters that really move.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 4: Choose a contest in Test it!. Sprint, Hurdles, Block Push, High Jump, Lap, races and Sumo.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.200
Step 5: Press Go! and watch. Real physics: nothing is scripted, so test, tweak and test again.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.400
Step 6: Compare in Results. Every test goes in a table, with a note of what you changed.
